# OmniRoute (token saving)

OmniRoute is running at `http://localhost:20128` (`/v1` for OpenAI-compatible calls).

- Prefer OmniRoute for extra model calls: `omniroute chat`, Codex profiles (`~/.codex/omniroute-*.config.toml`), or Claude Code pointed at OmniRoute.
- Do not spawn extra Cursor-billed subagents when a local OmniRoute CLI call can do the same job.
- This Cursor Agent/Composer session still uses Cursor's own models. Chat-panel BYOK with Override OpenAI Base URL is the in-app path; Agent mode stays on Cursor.

Base URL: `http://localhost:20128/v1`
Preferred models: `auto/best-coding`, `auto/best-fast`, `auto/best-reasoning`
API key: `OMNIROUTE_API_KEY` in `~/.omniroute/.env` (never paste it into chat or commits).
